{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>增美神維他命B雜丸每瓶120粒，莎莎單瓶HK$138。</p>\n<h2>同規格單件報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>店舖</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單件價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>1瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜莎莎</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單件標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>龍豐</td>\n<td>$208</td>\n<td>$208</td>\n<td>單件標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>單件標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>單件標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>單件標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>$245</td>\n<td>單件標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>同款報價<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDb%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120%E7%B2%92/p/BP_241575\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/jamieson-vitamin-b-complex-50-120pcs/p/999136\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.sasa.com.hk/SalePage/Index/328858\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莎莎</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/Jamieson-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H6754005/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDB%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8-120%E7%B2%92/p/H6754005_S_H3281209184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDB%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120S/i/116572526.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn190331/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>維他命B群有助身體利用食物中的營養來產生能量。魚類、雞蛋和豆類等日常食物，也可提供不同種類的維他命B。如不確定自己是否需要額外補充，或已服用其他含維他命B的產品，建議先向醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士查詢。（<a href=\"https://www.medlineplus.gov/bvitamins.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">維他命B群資料</a>）</p>\n<p>圖中價錢要買幾多件？<i></i></p>\n<p>莎莎單瓶$138。落單前核對規格及運費。</p>\n<p>揀購前要核對咩配方同標籤？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較 B Complex 50、120粒裝。已服用其他B雜維他命的話，先核對有冇重複成分及用量。 <a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDb%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120%E7%B2%92/p/BP_241575\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港零售標籤資料</a></p>\n<p>應該點樣保存？<i></i></p>\n<p>存放於15°C-25°C，遠離潮濕環境。避免兒童接觸誤服。 <a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDb%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120%E7%B2%92/p/BP_241575\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港零售標籤資料</a></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.936760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":0,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:54:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.333842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.333842+00:00","content_hash":"f7a8b134f7ad20c2c8d2c04382f1c517fb0790570390f51ec8cbdcf730a095f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}